statement.en:
Given a 16 cm by 16 cm square. Repeatedly divide the square into 4 equally sized squares by connecting the midpoints of the sides vertically and horizontally.

{{diagram:figure-e5f52b52b24b3e19}}

Stop after subdividing the square 5 times. What is the perimeter of the smallest square?

statement.zh:
已知一个边长为16 cm的正方形。通过在水平方向和垂直方向连接各边的中点,将该正方形反复划分为4个等大的正方形。

{{diagram:figure-e5f52b52b24b3e19}}

在共细分5次后停止。最小正方形的周长是多少?
